Hi Avery,

Your engineers probably already use Postman. Postman for teams adds the parts that matter once more than one person owns an API:

- Shared workspaces with version history
- Published API documentation that stays in sync with your collections
- Monitors that run your test collections on a schedule and alert on failures
- Role-based access for external partners

Basic team plans start at $14 per user per month. Teams migrating from another API tool get onboarding help at no cost.

Start a team workspace: https://postman.com/teams?ref=0320

